OL,3,GNEWSANeets reforms embraced by Cornish 
OL,4,Afishers                                
OL,6,FNew measures to reduce the number of   
OL,7,Fyoung people not earning or learning   
OL,8,Fhas been welcomed by Cornwall's seafood
OL,9,Findustry.                              
OL,11,FA report into how to tackle the rising 
OL,12,Fnumber of young people not in          
OL,13,Feducation, employment or training      
OL,14,F(Neet) was published this week.        
OL,16,FRecommendations included more tailored 
OL,17,Fsupport and a guaranteed offer of work 
OL,18,For training, but young people could    
OL,19,Freceive fewer benefits or have them    
OL,20,Fremoved if they failed to engage.      
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
