OL,3,GNEWSANeets reforms embraced by Cornish 
OL,4,Afishers                                
OL,6,FMatthew Stevens, who has worked in the 
OL,7,Ffish industry in St Ives for more than 
OL,8,F60 years, said he believed the         
OL,9,Frecommendations could mean some people 
OL,10,Fwho were put off by the sector could   
OL,11,Fgive it another look.                  
